;; Use case: publishing.
;;
;; The owner of an open publication publishes it: it is closed, each draft gets its minor
;; (the next after the latest published of its major, or 0), and every citation and link
;; by id becomes a citation by tnlr. Each step starts from snapshots, then the publications
;; written before it.
